 \section*{Ethical considerations}
 The auction data are a public research dataset of completed eBay listings. The source records include public bidder handles; our scenarios use only prices, and we do not redistribute the raw file. No human participants were involved. Our task scores one bidder against historical prices and studies no strategy aimed at other bidders.
